mock-components/**
# mock-dezi is part of the root Go module and is built from the repo root
# context, like sandbox/app; the other mock-components are separate stacks
# with their own build context and stay excluded from this one.
!mock-components/dezi/**

# Demo CA and signing keys from sandbox/generate-demo-certs.sh. Gitignored,
# but the Dockerfiles built from this context still do `COPY . .`, which
# would otherwise pull them into the builder stage regardless of git
# tracking. Keep this rule after the negation above so it is not
# re-included by it.
sandbox/.certs/

# Private key material and local runtime state, excluded by shape rather
# than by location so a new key directory does not silently start shipping.
# Nothing built from this context needs any of it: no Dockerfile copies a
# key, and no go:embed pattern matches one. `pki/cacerts/*.crt`, the only
# certificate material an image does need, is public and unaffected.
**/*.key
**/*_private.pem
data/